UID:txdotev-hm-us281-at-sh71-interchange-040926-20260409@calendars.changesa
 roundme.com
DTSTAMP:20260904T145749Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260409T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260409T193000
SUMMARY:TxDOT: US 281 at SH 71 Interchange
LOCATION:Marble Falls
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/austin/2026/us281-at-s
 h71-interchange-040926.html
DESCRIPTION:In-person meeting\; materials also posted online\nPublic commen
 t deadline: 24 Apr 2026.\n\n—\n\nPurpose: TxDOT is proposing to construc
 t a new interchange at US 281 and SH 71 from 1.5 miles north of SH 71 to 2
  miles south of SH 71 in Burnet County\, Texas. The purpose of the public 
 hearing is to present the environmental findings and provide an opportunit
 y for public comment. The draft environmental assessment will be available
  for public review.\n\nDescription: The proposed project includes construc
 ting a new interchange at US 281 and SH 71 in Burnet County. Upgrades to t
 his intersection will help improve safety and mobility. Proposed improveme
 nts include replacing the current cloverleaf interchange with a turbine in
 terchange\, adding elevated structures to improve mobility through the int
 erchange\, adding frontage roads to separate high-speed through traffic fr
 om local traffic and adding shared-use paths to accommodate bicyclists and
  pedestrians.\n\n—\n\nProject info: https://www.txdot.gov/projects/proje
 cts-studies/austin/us281-sh71-interchange.html
CATEGORIES:hearing
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
