UID:txdotev-hm-stip-may-2026-revision-20260505@calendars.changesaroundme.co
 m
DTSTAMP:20260904T145749Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260505
SUMMARY:TxDOT: Statewide Transportation Improvement Program: May 2026 Revis
 ion
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/statewide/2026/stip-ma
 y-2026-revision.html
DESCRIPTION:Virtual meeting - online materials only\; no fixed time (no in-
 person meeting)\nPublic comment deadline: 18 May 2026.\n\n—\n\nPurpose: 
 To receive public comments on the proposed May 2026 Revision to the Statew
 ide Transportation Improvement Program (STIP) for FY 2025 - 2028.\n\nDescr
 iption: The STIP identifies federally funded transportation projects inclu
 ded in the FY 2025–2028 Transportation Improvement Programs (TIPs) for e
 ach Metropolitan Planning Organization (MPO) in Texas. It also includes st
 ate and federally funded projects in nonattainment areas—Dallas-Fort Wor
 th\, El Paso\, Houston\, and San Antonio—as well as federally funded pro
 jects in rural areas outside MPO boundaries and other statewide programs.\
 nFederal law (Title 23 USC §§134 and 135) requires MPOs and states to de
 velop TIPs and STIPs to secure federal transportation funding. These plans
  must be developed in cooperation with MPOs\, transit operators\, and loca
 l officials\, and must include opportunities for public participation and 
 approval by the Governor or designee.\nA copy of the proposed May 2026 Rev
 ision to the FY 2025–2028 STIP will be available for review when this no
 tice is published on TxDOT's website.\n\n—\n\nProject info: https://www.
 txdot.gov/projects/planning/stip.html
CATEGORIES:hearing
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
